## Author and Contribution

**Author:** Himanshu Singh

**Contribution:** Decoder-Only Transformer Architecture from Scratch

This implementation is contributed by Himanshu Singh to [BlueprintML](https://github.com/AbhinandanMandal/BlueprintML). The contribution includes the implementation and adaptation of a GPT-style decoder-only Transformer in PyTorch, covering causal multi-head self-attention, positional embeddings, decoder blocks, next-token language modeling, training, and autoregressive text generation.

The implementation is based on my existing Transformer work and is being adapted to meet BlueprintML's contribution requirements, with a focus on modularity, reproducibility, testing, and documentation.

